,"endLine":283,"line":280},"type":4,"typeText":"Lean.Grind.Linarith.Poly → Lean.Grind.Linarith.Poly → Lean.Grind.Linarith.Poly → Bool","unsafe":false,"value":62,"source":{"code":"def le_lt_combine_cert (p₁ p₂ p₃ : Poly) : Bool :=\n  let a₁ := p₁.leadCoeff.natAbs\n  let a₂ := p₂.leadCoeff.natAbs\n  a₁ > (0 : Int) && p₃ == (p₁.mul a₂ |>.combine (p₂.mul a₁))","start":280,"end":283},"axioms":[]}